{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Background-Color Light Wrap.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Background-Color Light Wrap.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"background color light wrap background color light wrap","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Background-Color Light Wrap.md","fileName":"Background-Color Light Wrap.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Background-Color Light Wrap","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[CG Integration and Render Passes]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["CG Integration and Render Passes","Alpha Channel as Compositing Matte","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Background-Color Light Wrap.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Background-Color Light Wrap.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"background color light wrap background color light wrap","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Background-Color Light Wrap.md","fileName":"Background-Color Light Wrap.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Background-Color Light Wrap","heading":"Background-Color Light Wrap","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Light wrap softens the cutout look by letting nearby background colors appear at the foreground's edge. The book constructs an edge-limited matte from the foreground alpha, blurs the background color, and applies that color through the matte. This is not the same as placing a generic white glow around an object: the apparent light should be drawn from the actual plate and confined to the contact edge. The same edge isolation can help control color spill. See [[Alpha Channel as Compositing Matte]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["CG Integration and Render Passes","Alpha Channel as Compositing Matte","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pa